<% page_title "FAQ" %>
<header class="page-head"><div class="wrap narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Help</p><h1>Frequently asked questions</h1></div></header>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow">
<dl class="faq">
  <dt>Who teaches the courses?</dt>
  <dd>AI tutors. Each course has a named AI persona who guides you step by step and reviews your work against a published rubric. <%= brand.founder %>, the founder, designs the courses.</dd>
  <dt>Are the professors real people?</dt>
  <dd>No. They're characters played by AI, and we say so on every page.</dd>
  <dt>Is <%= brand.name %> accredited? Do I get a degree or credit?</dt>
  <dd>No. <%= brand.name %> isn't an accredited school and doesn't grant degrees or academic credit. When you finish a course, you get a certificate of completion and a portfolio of what you built.</dd>
  <dt>Will this get me a job?</dt>
  <dd>We don't promise that, and you should be wary of anyone who does. What we promise is the work: real projects, honest feedback, and a portfolio you can show.</dd>
  <dt>Do I need to know how to code?</dt>
  <dd>Not for AI Workflow Fundamentals. For the Agentic AI Bootcamp you need basic Python, and Week 1 is a refresher.</dd>
  <dt>Are there extra costs?</dt>
  <dd>The Agentic AI Bootcamp uses your own model API key for your exercises. Labs on the smallest model usually cost a few dollars in total. Set a spend limit and you stay in control. The in-site tutor is included.</dd>
  <dt>How long do I have access?</dt>
  <dd>You keep access to the course materials for as long as <%= brand.name %> offers the course.</dd>
  <dt>What's your refund policy?</dt>
  <dd>See <%= link_to "Refunds", refunds_path %>.</dd>
  <dt>Can I use my company's data in exercises?</dt>
  <dd>Please don't. Use made-up data or your own personal projects. The courses show you how.</dd>
  <dt>Do you offer team or company training?</dt>
  <dd>Yes, through <%= link_to "executive consulting", consulting_path %>.</dd>
</dl>
</div></section>
